---
// Final CTA — full-width dark card with gradient bg.
---
<section class="border-b border-border">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <div class="bg-hero-glow bg-bg-elevated border border-border rounded-2xl px-6 py-20 md:py-24 text-center shadow-2xl shadow-black/40">
      <h2 class="mb-6">Tell us what you're trying to build.</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">
        One email starts a technical conversation — not a sales funnel. Describe the
        problem in your own words; we'll come back with questions worth answering.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <a
          href="mailto:hello@leadflowautomation.net?subject=Project inquiry"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-accent text-white font-medium hover:bg-accent-hover transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-lg shadow-accent/20"
        >
          hello@leadflowautomation.net →
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-text-secondary text-xs">
        You'll get a reply from the engineer who would build it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
